>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"version_added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.93.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Crater_Chisel\">Crater Chisel</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Crater Chisel</b> is an item added from the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Halloween_Event\" title=\"2025 Halloween Event\">2025 Halloween event</a>. It can be obtained at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor\" title=\"The Monstrous Manor\">The Monstrous Manor</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_obtain\">How to obtain</span></h3>\n<p>The <b>Crater Chisel</b> can be obtained by crafting with <b><a href=\"/wiki/Hardened_Moon_Rod\" title=\"Hardened Moon Rod\">Hardened moon rod</a></b> and <b><a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Shard\" title=\"Moon Shard\">First Quarter Moon Shard</a></b> in Altar at the top of The Manor:\n</p>\n<ol><li>Go to 3rd floor of manor with <b>Hardened moon rod</b> and <b>First Quarter Moon Shard.</b></li>\n<li>Turn left and go to the window near the <a href=\"/wiki/Ghost\" title=\"Ghost\">Ghost NPC</a>.</li>\n<li>There are some levitating stones outside the window-<b>simple parkour</b> that you need to pass with components to craft the chisel.</li>\n<li>Place <b>Hardened moon rod</b> and <b>first quarter moon shard</b> to altar and wait till the reaction.</li></ol>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 397px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/90/Lunar_tools.png/revision/latest?cb=20251018115604\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Crater Chisel near all lunar tools\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/90/Lunar_tools.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/397?cb=20251018115604\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"397\" height=\"209\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Lunar tools.png\" data-image-key=\"Lunar_tools.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Lunar_tools.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><b>Crater Chisel</b> near all lunar tools</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163143\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 77/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 71/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019491/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.161      1 Template:Tool\n100.00%   43.161      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idh